profile_short_name:1500-2000m Rest
profile_designer:Kaffelogic Ltd
profile_description:\vThe “Rest” profiles have been developed for maximum flavour results in roasted coffee. They are perfect for those occasions where you are still working your way through a Kaffelogic roasted origin or blend and you know you will have no coffee after 3 to 5 days time.\v\vThese profiles have been designed for the coffee roasted on the Kaffelogic to be rested in airtight containers and allowed to de-gas over 3 to 5 days before the beans are ground, brewed and extracted.  \v\vDefault roast for a Medium roast profile  = 3.2 Recommended End (Great for Espresso + Aeropress , Rich Balanced espresso with medium body)\v\vMedium/Light roast profile                        = 2.5 Recommended End (Great for Pour Overs + Plungers and bright espresso) \v\vMedium/Dark roast profile                         = 4.3 Recommended End (Great for Espresso with Rich intense deep notes) \v
